
# --- generated trees -------------------------------------------------------
# Collapse generated output in pull requests and keep it out of language
# stats. Deliberately NOT `-diff` (we still want a readable local diff) and
# deliberately NO merge driver: a `merge=ours` here would resolve conflicts by
# silently picking a side, which is the opposite of how conflicts get resolved
# in this org. Regenerate and commit the result instead.
generated/**       linguist-generated=true
**/generated/**    linguist-generated=true
